        "description": "<h3 id=\"not-surviving-a-titan’s-grasp\"><em>Not Surviving a Titan’s Grasp</em></h3>\n<p>Once a player has had a chance to try and free themselves from a Titan’s grasp, all players who wish to intervene must <strong>Roll + Agility</strong>. On a 6 or lower, they cannot reach the person in time. On a 7-9, they can intervene, but must act immediately. On a 10+, they may deal with something else before intervening with the Titan grabbing the player.  <br />\nIf the player has failed every attempt at escaping, and no players were fast enough to intervene, the Titan eats the player, and they die.</p>",
