        "equipped": true,
        "uses": 0,
        "source": "Equipment",
        "description": "<h2 id=\"equipment\">Equipment</h2>\n<p>The equipment that you start off with is ultimately up to the Game Master. If you’re fighting Titans, you’ll likely have ODM gear, but if you’re just off to fight people, then maybe you’ll only be equipped with rifles and knives. Generally though, there are various “packs” of sorts that can make it easy for the GM to quickly tell you what you should have. These packs are only seen as a guideline for GMs that just want a quick and easy way of telling their players what equipment to take, and are by no means mandatory.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">Scout/ Garrison Pack</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;\">ODM Gear, 2x Canisters of Gas, 6x Blades, Water Canteen, Tactical Knife, Bandages, Compass, Satchel, Lantern. Pick One: Full First-Aid Kit Flare Gun and one flare of green, red, and black. Extra Gas Canisters (-1 Agility) 5 Days of Rations Full Backpack (Remove Satchel from Inventory)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Interior Police Pack</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Water Canteen, Tactical Knife, Bandages, Map of stationed area, Rifle, 5 Rifle Magazines, Satchel. Pick One: ODM Gear, 2x Blades, 2x Canisters of Gas (Available at GM’s discretion.) AHSS Gear, 6x Shells, 2x Canisters of Gas (Available at GM’s discretion.) 4 Rifle Magazines Full First-Aid Kit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Marleyan Infiltrator Pack</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Water Canteen, Tactical Knife, Bandages, Disinfectant, Semi-Automatic Pistol, 10 Pistol Magazines, Compass, Short-Range Radio, Flashlight.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
