        "key": "armoured-titan",
        "description": "<p>This Titan is covered in nearly unbreakable armour, which shatters any blades that come into contact with it. The Armoured Titan receives minor wounds as normal from fighting another Titan, but will not lose consciousness.  When shifted, the Armoured Titan has twice its base consciousness. The Armoured Titan’s Agility is also one point lower than it regularly would be.  This is lost if his armour is broken, and fighting will go as normal if the opponent’s hands are reinforced with hardening or something equivalent. After falling beneath half consciousness from someone with hardened hands, your armour is broken. When Wrestling, the person with the upper hand may <strong>Roll + Body</strong>. On a 10 or higher, they manage to break the Armoured Titan’s armour. The armoured Titan can also choose to break their own armour, to regain their point of agility. When fighting, running, or doing anything strenuous, heat will build up inside of the Armoured Titan. If this is not vented by standing still and opening your mouth, the user inside will begin to take burn wounds. This does not apply if the armour is broken. An explosive, such as a bundle of dynamite, or a shot gas canister, is often enough to blow apart your armour.</p>",
